<Base title="About Modern Software & Glen Adamson" description="Meet Glen Adamson, founder of Modern Software. Software engineering, product collaboration and consultancy from Portadown, Northern Ireland."><section class="page-hero wrap"><span class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE BUSINESS</span><h1>Experience.<br/>Curiosity.<br/><em>A practical approach.</em></h1><p>Modern Software is Glen Adamson’s software development and consultancy business, based in Portadown, Northern Ireland.</p></section><section class="founder-section wrap"><a class="portrait-frame" href="https://www.glenadamson.co.uk/about"><Image src={glen} format="webp" quality={85} width="460" height="460" alt="Glen Adamson in pixel art"/><span>MEET GLEN ON GLENADAMSON.CO.UK ↗</span></a><div><span class="eyebrow">FOUNDER / SOFTWARE ENGINEER / CONSULTANT</span><h2>Hi, I’m <a href="https://www.glenadamson.co.uk/about">Glen<span class="pink">.</span></a></h2><p>I founded Modern Software in May 2021, bringing together hands-on software engineering, technical leadership and experience working directly with businesses.</p><p>My career has included product and engineering leadership at Sentel, architecture and technical leadership at Allstate, and full-stack cloud development at Relative. Consultancy engagements through Modern Software have included LoweConex, Sensoteq and TerraQuest.</p><p>I enjoy understanding how a business works, asking useful questions and turning complex requirements into clear, maintainable software.</p><a class="button outline" href="https://www.glenadamson.co.uk/about">Explore my career timeline <span>↗</span></a></div></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="section-intro"><h2>Built on experience.<br/>Always learning<span class="pink">.</span></h2><p>Recent work centres on React, TypeScript and operational applications. Broader experience includes React Native, Node.js, Laravel, AWS and Azure. Technology follows the needs of the project.</p></div><div class="three-grid">{[['Understand the business.','The people and their workflow come first. Software needs to make sense in the context where it is used.'],['Work together.','Direct communication, useful reviews and clear decisions connect engineering with product priorities.'],['Build for what follows.','Maintainability, testing and knowledge sharing matter beyond the first release.']].map(([t,d])=><article class="detail-card"><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>)}</div></section><section class="about-personal wrap"><span class="eyebrow">BEYOND MODERN SOFTWARE</span><h2>There’s a person<br/>behind the pixels.</h2><p>My personal site brings together working demos, creative experiments, running progress and the football statistics I use while coaching Under 11s.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.glenadamson.co.uk">Visit glenadamson.co.uk ↗</a></section><CTA/></Base>
